  "transcript_turns": [
    {
      "speaker": "customer",
      "text": "This is becoming a real blocker for us. workspace setup is blocked at domain verification.",
      "turn": 1
    },
    {
      "speaker": "agent",
      "text": "Let's separate what we know from what we still need to verify. When did this first start?",
      "turn": 2
    },
    {
      "speaker": "customer",
      "text": "customer says DNS was updated",
      "turn": 3
    },
    {
      "speaker": "agent",
      "text": "That points me toward billing hold, but I want to keep this tentative. What changed right before the issue started?",
      "turn": 4
    },
    {
      "speaker": "customer",
      "text": "The confusing part is this: An early symptom seems to support billing hold, but later evidence weakens it.",
      "turn": 5
    },
    {
      "speaker": "agent",
      "text": "Let's test billing hold first. If that fits, we should see the same behavior on a known-good example.",
      "turn": 6
    },
    {
      "speaker": "customer",
      "text": "We checked one example and it seemed to fit, but then another example did not. workspace setup is blocked at domain verification, but verification has been pending for several hours.",
      "turn": 7
    },
    {
      "speaker": "agent",
      "text": "That weakens billing hold. I am going to abandon that path for now and check workspace region mismatch.",
      "turn": 8
    },
    {
      "speaker": "customer",
      "text": "workspace region mismatch happened to us once before, so that sounds plausible, but the symptoms are not exactly the same.",
      "turn": 9
    },
    {
      "speaker": "agent",
      "text": "Agreed. workspace region mismatch is possible, but the evidence is mixed. I need a comparison between a working and blocked case.",
      "turn": 10
    },
    {
      "speaker": "customer",
      "text": "One working case has the same visible setup. Also, the TXT record was added to app.company.com.",
      "turn": 11
    },
    {
      "speaker": "agent",
      "text": "That reverses the direction. The visible setup may not be the control point. I want to inspect the shared configuration boundary.",
      "turn": 12
    },
    {
      "speaker": "customer",
      "text": "I just got a note from someone else: customer's IT owner copied from a staging guide. customer's onboarding session is live while setup is blocked.",
      "turn": 13
    },
    {
      "speaker": "agent",
      "text": "That late detail finally makes the actual path coherent. The likely root cause is: Workspace domain verification is pending because DNS TXT record was added to the wrong subdomain.",
      "turn": 14
    },
    {
      "speaker": "customer",
      "text": "So the earlier checks were not wasted, but they were pointing at the wrong control point?",
      "turn": 15
    },
    {
      "speaker": "agent",
      "text": "Correct. The earlier paths were plausible but abandoned after conflicting evidence. Final outcome: agent identifies wrong DNS record placement and gives exact correction",
      "turn": 16
    }
  ],
